{"id":"n14766-1-7","stage":2,"title":"악몽 · 噩梦","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14766-1-7-1","ko":"무슨 걱정이라도 있어?","zh":"有什么烦恼吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정이라도","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정이라도","audio":"/audio/bac50348127f0944ef88.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac1fffe94bb2bbbfd1c4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14766-1-7-2","ko":"간밤에 악몽을 꿨더니 기분이 안 좋네.","zh":"昨晚做了噩梦，所以心情不太好呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"간밤에","meaning":"昨夜","explanation":"간밤：昨夜；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"간밤","audio":"/audio/40da640ed2f58f2d189d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15456","senseId":"1","lemma":"간밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간밤에","audio":"/audio/85bbfad1a79da167b292.mp3"}},{"text":"악몽을","meaning":"噩梦","explanation":"악몽：噩梦；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"악몽","audio":"/audio/14974d6d375732d2da28.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14766","senseId":"1","lemma":"악몽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"악몽을","audio":"/audio/f43b386e996227c5d0e8.mp3"}},{"text":"꿨더니","meaning":"做","explanation":"꾸다：做；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"꾸다","audio":"/audio/ea4054f32b1e1745e6a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62352","senseId":"1","lemma":"꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꿨더니","audio":"/audio/c2209390886c02ef4af4.mp3"}},{"text":"기분이","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기분이","audio":"/audio/2c7d19f699b942f8cc0b.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"좋네.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋네","audio":"/audio/706ff3c687e3893095c5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"40da640ed2f58f2d","term":"간밤","zh":"昨夜","audio":"/audio/40da640ed2f58f2d189d.mp3","entryId":"15456","definition":"昨天晚上；昨晚。","pronunciation":["간밤"]},{"id":"14974d6d375732d2","term":"악몽","zh":"噩梦","audio":"/audio/14974d6d375732d2da28.mp3","en